groovebox-scene 1
# A signature change while playing. Syn 1 on pad 1 through the panel: MENU + step 3 shows SOUND's
# Pad page and OK opens the sound picker on Empty; down twice to New synth and OK choose it.
input 3200 press menu
input 4800 press step-3
input 6400 release step-3
input 8000 release menu
input 9600 press ok
input 11200 release ok
input 12800 press down
input 14400 release down
input 16000 press down
input 17600 release down
input 19200 press ok
input 20800 release ok
# Taps of steps 1, 5, 9, 13 and 15 enter five notes of Syn 1 in bar 1.
input 22400 press step-1
input 24000 release step-1
input 25600 press step-5
input 27200 release step-5
input 28800 press step-9
input 30400 release step-9
input 32000 press step-13
input 33600 release step-13
input 35200 press step-15
input 36800 release step-15
# MENU + step 9 shows PATTERN, and PAGE + step 2 its Bars page: Length 1 bar and Signature 4/4.
input 38400 press menu
input 40000 press step-9
input 41600 release step-9
input 43200 release menu
input 44800 press page
input 46400 press step-2
input 48000 release step-2
input 49600 release page
frame 51200
# Push 1 opens the Length picker on 1 bar, and down twice onto 4 bars and OK choose it. It adds
# three empty bars and deletes nothing, so it applies at once.
input 52800 press push-1
input 54400 release push-1
input 56000 press down
input 57600 release down
input 59200 press down
input 60800 release down
frame 64000
input 65600 press ok
input 67200 release ok
# PLAY starts bar 1 at its press. A 4/4 bar is 96,000 samples, so bar 2 starts at 164,800.
input 68800 press play
input 70400 release play
# In bar 2 push 2 opens the Signature picker on 4/4, and up onto 3/4 and OK ask "Delete 2 notes?",
# as steps 13 and 15 lie past the end of a 3/4 bar. OK deletes them, and 3/4 takes hold at the
# next bar line, 260,800, so bar 2 keeps its four beats.
input 166400 press push-2
input 168000 release push-2
input 169600 press up
input 171200 release up
input 172800 press ok
input 174400 release ok
frame 176000
input 177600 press ok
input 179200 release ok
# Bar 3 plays in 3/4, 72,000 samples long, and the header shows "3/4 ▶3".
frame 265600
# In bar 3 push 1 opens the Length picker on 4 bars, and up onto 2 bars and OK choose it. Bars 3
# and 4 hold no notes, so no question comes. It takes hold at the next bar line, 332,800, where bar
# 4 lies past the new length and the music wraps to bar 1: the header shows "1/2 ▶1".
input 268800 press push-1
input 270400 release push-1
input 272000 press up
input 273600 release up
input 275200 press ok
input 276800 release ok
frame 336000
# STOP stops the pattern and leaves the cursor on bar 1, the bar that played. A second STOP fades
# every voice.
input 339200 press stop
input 340800 release stop
input 342400 press stop
input 344000 release stop
frame 345600
end 348800
